    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ogdŏas</span></b> , ădis,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀγδοάς</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>the number
				eight</i> (eccl. Lat.), <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep.
			36</span></i>, n. 9.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>one of the œons of
				Valentinus</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val. 7</span></i>
			and 20; <i><span class="en">id. Anim. 37</span></i>.</div>
